om/users/jobfynder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":false,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/compare/b31405158916...45ad13b6ce3a","commits":[{"id":"45ad13b6ce3a46ce8d8bfc21c14194a0e2588961","tree_id":"93e190e6ae4775efddd434cac843b722121e7781","distinct":true,"message":"fix(taxonomy): sanitize embedded newlines before LLM batch triage prompt\n\nA candidate term with an embedded newline or non-breaking space (a\nstray parsing artifact from an already-queued older candidate) turned\ninto an extra fake line in the numbered prompt list, throwing off the\nmodel's item count and reliably producing a mismatched-length\nresponse on every retry -- confirmed against a real stuck batch in\nproduction (a title containing \"HANA \\xa0 \\xa0 \\xa0 \\n\\nRN SAP\nBOBJ Admin Consultant\"). Whitespace is now collapsed to single spaces\nfor prompting only; the stored candidate term is never modified.\nVerified against the actual stuck batch: it now resolves cleanly\n(31 approved, 11 rejected, 0 left for review) instead of failing all\n3 retries every run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-02T15:35:05-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/45ad13b6ce3a46ce8d8bfc21c14194a0e2588961","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T15:35:05-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T15:35:05-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["scripts/hermes-900-daily-taxonomy-triage.py"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"45ad13b6ce3a46ce8d8bfc21c14194a0e2588961","tree_id":"93e190e6ae4775efddd434cac843b722121e7781","distinct":true,"message":"fix(taxonomy): sanitize embedded newlines before LLM batch triage prompt\n\nA candidate term with an embedded newline or non-breaking space (a\nstray parsing artifact from an already-queued older candidate) turned\ninto an extra fake line in the numbered prompt list, throwing off the\nmodel's item count and reliably producing a mismatched-length\nresponse on every retry -- confirmed against a real stuck batch in\nproduction (a title containing \"HANA \\xa0 \\xa0 \\xa0 \\n\\nRN SAP\nBOBJ Admin Consultant\"). Whitespace is now collapsed to single spaces\nfor prompting only; the stored candidate term is never modified.\nVerified against the actual stuck batch: it now resolves cleanly\n(31 approved, 11 rejected, 0 left for review) instead of failing all\n3 retries every run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-09-02T15:35:05-04:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder/hermes/commit/45ad13b6ce3a46ce8d8bfc21c14194a0e2588961","author":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T15:35:05-04:00"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder Automation","email":"automation@jobfynder.com","date":"2026-09-02T15:35:05-04:00"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["scripts/hermes-900-daily-taxonomy-triage.py"]}}
